{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-298889-r4618212","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Lemon Meringue Pie (Vegan)","sourcePageId":298889,"sourceRevision":"4618212","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2026-02-08T15:00:02Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Mathmitch7","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Lemon%20Meringue%20Pie%20(Vegan)&oldid=4618212","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:07:20.077Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for dessert","Category:Recipes for lemon meringue pie","Category:Recipes using agar","Category:Recipes using baking powder","Category:Recipes using cornstarch","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using guar gum","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using lemon zest","Category:Recipes using potato starch","Category:Recipes using tapioca starch","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Vegan recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"423fa2b0afe68a12b9e36d61794f8e808a9d78bed856877ea59360fd0bf59384","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Pie recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{Recipe}}\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n* 1 baked vegan [[Cookbook:Pie Crust|pie crust]]\n\n===Filling===\n*1¼ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] white granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n*½ cup [[Cookbook:Cornstarch|cornstarch]] \n*¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Agar|agar]]\n*¼ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*1 ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Nondairy Milk|non-dairy milk]] \n*1 cup cold [[Cookbook:Water|water]]\n*¾ cup fresh [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]] juice\n*1 ½ [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] lemon [[Cookbook:Zest|zest]]\n*⅛ teaspoons [[Cookbook:Turmeric|turmeric]]\n\n===Meringue===\n*9 teaspoons [[Cookbook:Tapioca Starch|tapioca starch]]\n*9 teaspoons [[Cookbook:Potato Starch|potato starch]]\n*1 ½ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n*¾ teaspoons [[Cookbook:Guar Gum|guar gum]]\n*½ cup + 2 tablespoons cold water\n*½ cup white granulated sugar\n*¾ teaspoons lemon juice\n\n==Procedure==\n===Filling===\n#Add all the filling ingredients to a [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]], bring to [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]], and whisk for a few minutes. When you can’t stir anymore it’s ready. \n#Keep the filling warm and covered while preparing the meringue.\n\n===Meringue===\n#Combine the starches, baking powder, guar gum, lemon juice, and about half the water. [[Cookbook:Whipping|Whip]] by hand until stiff peaks start to form. \n#Add the rest of the water and the sugar slowly, and mix. It should be thick enough that it will have stiff peaks that don’t fall. If it is not thick enough, mix in a little more tapioca starch.\n\n===Pie===\n#As soon as the meringue is done, pour the filling into the pie crust. While the filling is hot, spread meringue over filling, carefully sealing to edge of crust. Using a rubber [[Cookbook:Spatula|spatula]], touch flat side of spatula on meringue and pull away. Repeat over entire surface of meringue.\n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] in a 350 °F (180 °C) [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] for 10–15 minutes. Cool on rack for 1 hour. \n#Serve at room temperature or chilled.\n\n==Warnings==\n* The pie filling is quite hot when pouring it into pie shell.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes for lemon meringue pie|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Vegan recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using agar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornstarch]]\n[[Category:Recipes using guar gum]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon zest]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tapioca starch]]\n[[Category:Recipes using potato starch]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Lemon Meringue Pie (Vegan)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 baked vegan pie crust","sourceText":"1 baked vegan pie crust","amountText":"1 baked vegan pie crust","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1¼ cup white granulated sugar","sourceText":"1¼ cup white granulated sugar","amountText":"1¼ cup white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"½ cup cornstarch","sourceText":"½ cup cornstarch","amountText":"½ cup cornstarch","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"¼ teaspoon agar","sourceText":"¼ teaspoon agar","amountText":"¼ teaspoon agar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"¼ teaspoon salt","sourceText":"¼ teaspoon salt","amountText":"¼ teaspoon salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 ¼ cup non-dairy milk","sourceText":"1 ¼ cup non-dairy milk","amountText":"1 ¼ cup non-dairy milk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 cup cold water","sourceText":"1 cup cold water","amountText":"1 cup cold water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"¾ cup fresh lemon juice","sourceText":"¾ cup fresh lemon juice","amountText":"¾ cup fresh lemon juice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"so